cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data, please cite it as below."
title: "Socratos data: Greek and Latin texts, parses and dictionaries"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Socratos"
    website: "https://socratos.org"
abstract: >-
  Open Greek and Latin reading data from Socratos (https://socratos.org), a free
  reader for ancient Greek and Latin: 555 Greek and 170 Latin works from the
  Perseus Digital Library, every word with its lemma and parse, Liddell-Scott-Jones
  and Lewis & Short dictionary entries, short English meanings, citations and
  paradigm tables, as plain TSV and JSON Lines.
url: "https://socratos.org"
repository-code: "https://github.com/tferris13/socratos-data"
license: CC-BY-SA-4.0
keywords:
  - Ancient Greek
  - Latin
  - lemmatization
  - morphology
  - LSJ
  - Lewis and Short
  - Perseus
  - Classics
  - digital humanities
